; PsiLinux-X 0.25 (test): the PsiLinux desktop, X11 on the Psion's own screen,
; for PsiLinux 0.25 and later. psiwm: the window manager, toolbar and programs.
; The X server (kdrive Xfbdev, built for the 5mx), xsetroot, xeyes and xterm, with the
; keyboard maps. In PsiLinux: sh /d/Linux/X/startx (or /c/... if installed on C:).
&EN
#{"PsiLinux X"},(0x01000A91),0,25,0
"Xfbdev"-"!:\Linux\X\Xfbdev"
"xsetroot"-"!:\Linux\X\xsetroot"
"xeyes"-"!:\Linux\X\xeyes"
"xterm"-"!:\Linux\X\xterm"
"psiwm"-"!:\Linux\X\psiwm"
"psisplash"-"!:\Linux\X\psisplash"
"psiwm-alone"-"!:\Linux\X\psiwm-alone"
"startx"-"!:\Linux\X\startx"
"stopx"-"!:\Linux\X\stopx"
"default.xkm"-"!:\Linux\X\psi\default.xkm"
"gb.xkm"-"!:\Linux\X\psi\gb.xkm"
"us.xkm"-"!:\Linux\X\psi\us.xkm"
"licences.txt"-"!:\Linux\X\Licences.txt"
